    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent almost new A rated 3 bedroom detached residence extending to 116 sq.m. This is a rare opportunity to purchase a fine detached house in the popular development Bridgegate which is excellently located walking distance from all the amenities in Ardee.\n\nNo 5 Bridgegate Drive is excellently positioned to the front of the development not overlooked to the front with a lovely green area and enjoys amazing views of the nearby Town. This house has been finished with top quality flooring, tiling, landscaped rear garden and is presented with a lovely modern kitchen with top quality appliances.\n\nMany rooms in this house enjoys dual aspect ensuring excellent light filled accommodation. Ardee Town is a 5 minute walk and the property enjoys very easy access to the N2 and M1 routes to Dublin City, Dundalk, Belfast and Navan. Accommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen / Dining, 3 Bedrooms (Main ensuite) and Bathroom.\n\nFIXTURES & FITTINGS\nAll flooring, blinds, light fittings, oven, hob, extractor fans, integrated fridge freezer and integrated dishwasher are included in the sale.\n\nFEATURES\n• Detached Home\n• Turnkey condition\n• Walking distance to Ardee Town\n• Wide side access\n• A rated residence\n• Landscaped rear garden\n• Gas heating & solar panels\n• Double glazed windows and doors\n• 2 x private parking\n\n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hall-4.55 x 2.62\nWith tiled flooring, composite front door and two storage rooms.\n\nLounge-5.72 x 3.83\nDual aspect with wooden flooring, feature electric wall mounted fire and patio doors to the rear garden.\n\nKitchen-6.87 x 3.40\nSuperbly fitted with tiled flooring, modern built in wall and floor units, splashback tiling, oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer and integrated dishwasher.\n\nGuest w.c.-1.93 x 1.43\nWith tiled flooring, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLanding\nWith carpet and hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1-4.41 x 3.07\nWith wooden flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite-3.06 x 1.21\nWith tiled flooring, partially tiled walls, w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\nBedroom 2-3.41 x 3.25\nWith wooden flooring and free-standing wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3-3.43 x 3.26\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nBathroom-2.16 x 1.76\nWith tiled flooring, partially tiled walls, w.c., w.h.b. and bath.\n\nDIRECTIONS\nEIRCODE A92 CC7F"
      },
